.SH NAME
SystemEx.Collections.Generic.RCUCache \- Provides a Read‑Copy‑Update (RCU) wrapper around a \fBCache\fP instance\&. Readers operate lock‑free using epoch tracking, while writers acquire an exclusive lock to ensure consistent updates\&. This enables deterministic, high‑performance concurrent access to a byte‑addressable memory buffer\&.  

